@startuml
title State Diagram - Purchase Workflow Lifecycle

[*] --> DraftRequest
DraftRequest --> SubmittedForReview : employee submit request
SubmittedForReview --> RequestRework : reviewer requests changes
RequestRework --> DraftRequest : employee revises
SubmittedForReview --> Reviewed : reviewer approves request

Reviewed --> POCreated : create purchase order
POCreated --> PendingApproval : send to approver
PendingApproval --> ApprovalRejected : approver rejects PO
ApprovalRejected --> POCreated : revise PO details
PendingApproval --> ApprovedPO : approver approves PO

ApprovedPO --> AcknowledgedBySupplier : supplier submits order acknowledgement
AcknowledgedBySupplier --> DeliveryCreated : supplier creates delivery
DeliveryCreated --> GRNPending : waiting buyer GRN processing
GRNPending --> GoodsReceived : buyer records goods received note
GoodsReceived --> Closed : workflow finished

Closed --> [*]

@enduml
